# Target C: full-cover closure of the final eight-no-root `k=7` profile

Date: 2026-09-22

Status: **closed for the current eight-no-root `k=7` finite split.** This note records a complete exact execution of the seven-row functional-lift obstruction for the last surviving profile

```text
C:(d_v,q,s)=(5,12,12),   d_6=5.
```

It closes that finite profile. It does **not** promote Target C-II or Erdős Problem #99 to solved; the canonical global Target C state remains governed by `docs/targets/target-c/CURRENT.md` and `docs/state/theorem-state.yaml`.

## 1. Closure criterion

The six-row replacement-functional inequality forces every surviving `d_6=5` shadow to have singleton-functional extra rank ten, the full six-row quotient dimension. After restoring one deleted no-root cycle, deficiency monotonicity forces

```text
d_7=5,   singleton capacity >= 11.
```

At seven rows,

```text
D_7 >= 7 + p_7 + 3 d_7 - 3 s_7
```

with `D_7=1`, `p_7=12`, and `d_7=5`, so

```text
s_7 >= 11.
```

The seven-row functional quotient has dimension exactly eleven. Therefore an actual target must produce a qualifying one-cycle lift whose compatible singleton functionals have extra rank eleven.

The committed verifier implementing this criterion is

```text
research/verify_target_c_support7_global_segment_relative_seven_noroot_k6_C_d5q12_d5_functional_lift_2026_09_22.py
```

with Git blob SHA

```text
3e6eba3fffcbbf4be4f76ec375ad60332568ebe7.
```

The verifier deliberately inserts every compatible singleton state from every virtual-complete block. This is an over-approximation of an actual all-singleton profile, so failure even in that enlarged family is a valid obstruction.

## 2. Complete execution

The exact 325,955-representative six-row augmentation cover was partitioned into 1,304 disjoint half-open intervals, each of width 250 except the final interval. The intervals cover

```text
[0,325955)
```

with no gaps or overlaps. The aggregate census was

```text
synchronized_states                 1,751,870
six_full_rank_witnesses               136,450
seven_d5_capacity_ge11_lifts           968,687
retained_six_full_span_lifts             49,249
seven_full_rank_lifts                         0
max_seven_extra_rank                         10
```

Every one of the 49,249 lifts that retained the required six-row rank-ten span had seven-row extra rank exactly ten. None reached eleven.

